        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007b.A.dialog-act.vkaraisk.90",
          "participant": "MTD025PM",
          "role": "PM",
          "text": "but I think that's we wel <vocalsound> later in the stage ."
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3007b.A.dialog-act.vkaraisk.95",
          "participant": "MTD025PM",
          "role": "PM",
          "text": "so they want the the the normal functions like teletext , volume changing , um uh to be uh , yeah , kinda traditionals"
